        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPG18, Heavy Duty Solid Brass 18\" Offset Surface Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana 18 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolt can be installed horizontally or vertically on the surface of almost any door. The guides on this heavy duty door bolt are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, hold tension on the bolt and prevents rattling of the guides. Package includes 18 inch surface bolt, mortise strike plate, universal strike plate, angle strike plate, 3 bolt guides and matching oval phillips head finish brass wood screws. The FPG18 18 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolt is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPG18-Dimentions.gif?v=1704354611\" width=\"600\" height=\"320\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FPG18 18\" Offset Surface Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg610b\"><b>6\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-10-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg10\"><b>10\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-26-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg26\"><b>26\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-42-inch-offset-surface-bolt-deltana-fpg42\"><b>42\" Offset Surface Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FPG18 18 Inch Offset Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Offset: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection:  1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Resistance: 109 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3 Strike Plates</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all mounting hardware</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: oval phillips head #6 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPG18-specifications.pdf?v=1704262316\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPG18 18 Inch Surface Bolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 18 Inch Offset Surface Bolt, Deltana FPG18",
                "description": "Deltana FPG18, Solid Brass 18 Inch Offset Surface Bolt - This Deltana 18 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolt can be installed horizontally or vertically on the surface of almost any door. The guides on this heavy duty door bolt are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, hold tension on the bolt and prevents rattling of the guides. Package includes 18 inch surface bolt, mortise strike plate, universal strike plate, angle strike plate, 3 bolt guides and matching oval phillips head finish brass wood screws. The 18 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolt is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes.",
                "keywords": "DEL-FPG18 18-inch Offset Security Bolt Heavy Duty 18 Inch Offset Surface Door Bolts, deltana FPG18 offset surface bolts, door slide bolts, 18 inch door bolts, 18 inches door bolts, slidebolts, deltana 18 inch offset surface bolts, surface mounted door bolts, FPG1815, FPG1815A, FPG1819, FPG1810B, FPG1826, FPG1826D, FPG183, FPG185,"
